                              LastCallers v1.0
                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

                          By Agamemnon / Moment 22

USAGE: LastCallers <node> <status[-status]> <datafile> <bullfile>

where <datafile> is a unique file for different statuslevels. 
For example, if you want a LastCallers-list that only shows
PD-users with statuslevel 20-30 you can use:

LastCallers <node> 20-30 s:lastcallers2030.dat bbs:nodex/bull.txt

and a separate list for Elite-users with level 50:

LastCallers <node> 50 s:lastcallers50.dat bbs:nodex/bull50.txt

